  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast bias when sentiment is negative (sentiment < 0) — model tends to overestimate prices.",
    "Adjust downward for forecasts that overshoot recent highs — especially after sentiment spikes.",
    "Apply mean reversion correction for persistent overestimation in 3–5 consecutive days.",
    "Lower forecast for periods with sentiment > 0.5 — model exhibits overconfidence in upward moves.",
    "Increase forecast lag correction when sentiment is neutral or slightly positive — model reacts too quickly to short-term noise.",
    "Apply downward bias correction when true outcome is consistently below 3-day moving average of forecast — indicates model overestimates trend."
  ]
